WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.934 --> 00:00:02.528
Imagine a new room.

2
00:00:02.951 --> 00:00:04.740
Before you move a thing.

3
00:00:05.108 --> 00:00:06.911
Meet WorldOS!

4
00:00:09.379 --> 00:00:11.285
Start with a photo and a goal.

5
00:00:11.501 --> 00:00:15.758
Meta Muse Spark proposes a layout and explains the placement choices.

6
00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:23.840
SAM 3.1 locates prompted objects in photos,

7
00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:27.030
supporting detailed recognition and review.

8
00:00:29.378 --> 00:00:31.242
Choose from thirty six pieces.

9
00:00:31.446 --> 00:00:35.173
Edit sizes and finishes, explore in 3D,

10
00:00:35.466 --> 00:00:36.889
then preview in AR.

11
00:00:41.378 --> 00:00:44.382
There it is! Virtual furniture in your real room.

12
00:00:44.598 --> 00:00:47.234
Look around and see how the pieces work together.

13
00:00:52.368 --> 00:00:54.890
Save in My Spaces and keep creating.

14
00:00:55.120 --> 00:00:58.492
WorldOS. Make room. Get going!
